<title>UK: Marley deputy chairman Allen to retire.</title>
<headline>Marley deputy chairman Allen to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building materials group Marley Plc said on Wednesday that Gary Allen would retire from his post as deputy chairman at the annual general meeting on May 15 this year.</p>
<p>Marley said Allen was a board member for eight years.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
